s6-5-p2 : Block
s6-5-p2 = prose (cons "Sharing is a property of a represented computation: two occurrences may refer to one" (cons "producer, and a dependent consumer requests a result from that producer. A producer" (cons "may contain an unfinished computation, a weak-head result, or a completed value." (cons "These states are distinguished by the computation's representation and transition" (cons "rules. Sharing changes the graph of dependencies; graph-based local reduction has an established account in interaction nets ([70](#ref-70)). It does not change the typing," (cons "substitution, or equality judgments of the represented terms." nil))))))
